{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/extras/9f9300a76f4713d3fe230797d15eb34a.avif?t=1761502881\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can bend the rules of time to outsmart your opponents!\u00a0 Play solo or online with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards each turn, trying to survive deadly weapons and bombs. Cards stack up creating a complex chain of events, requiring you to predict future outcomes. Certain spaces on the board can give advantages while others will send you on an impromptu space-walk. Time is bent and logical strategy is created in the moment depending on the game state. The depth is seen in the course of rounds you survive in, resulting in a fight over abundant parts of the map while avoiding dangerous locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, 2-4 Players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Board that changes each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out how the future will unfold by creating rifts in time and deploying time bombs as future explosives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize futuristic technology such as time machines, rocketships, as well as cryogenic chambers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Busted Cards From Spaces In Time, use them to tilt the scales in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865190?t=1761502881","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865190?t=1761502881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/0e997fe1a947b72571144a420c7b97c19a94b582/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761502881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/0e997fe1a947b72571144a420c7b97c19a94b582/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761502881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3737420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/extras/9f9300a76f4713d3fe230797d15eb34a.avif?t=1761502881\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can bend the rules of time to outsmart your opponents!\u00a0 Play solo or online with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards each turn, trying to survive deadly weapons and bombs. Cards stack up creating a complex chain of events, requiring you to predict future outcomes. Certain spaces on the board can give advantages while others will send you on an impromptu space-walk. Time is bent and logical strategy is created in the moment depending on the game state. The depth is seen in the course of rounds you survive in, resulting in a fight over abundant parts of the map while avoiding dangerous locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, 2-4 Players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Board that changes each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out how the future will unfold by creating rifts in time and deploying time bombs as future explosives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize futuristic technology such as time machines, rocketships, as well as cryogenic chambers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Busted Cards From Spaces In Time, use them to tilt the scales in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Kai","Myles","Finn","Logan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/b8313efc656d45228f3e2d341d35f18a17e22f86/header.jpg?t=1761502881","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865190/1574623512/8837667e0fe0861f412bbb3b56e9a3cb678cdb39/1760127766/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760135438","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865190/1574623512/8837667e0fe0861f412bbb3b56e9a3cb678cdb39/1760127766/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760135438","highlight":true